

PROJECT TITLE
LEGALEASE – AI-POWERED LEGAL DOCUMENT GENERATOR

1. FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS

• Collect required details from the user.
• Accept information such as document type, parties, terms and dates.
• Generate structured legal documents using AI.
• Allow users to edit the generated document.
• Provide document download options.

2. INPUT REQUIREMENTS

The system collects:

• Document type
• Involved parties
• Terms and conditions
• Effective date
• Other required document details

3. OUTPUT REQUIREMENTS

The system provides:

• Structured legal documents
• Editable content
• DOCX output
• PDF output
• HTML preview

4. TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS

• Python
• FastAPI
• Streamlit
• Google Gemini API
• Python-docx
• FPDF
• Pillow
• Requests
• Python-dotenv

5. USER REQUIREMENTS

The system should provide a simple interface where users can enter details, generate documents and edit or download the results.

6. NON-FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS

• Easy to use
• Accurate formatting
• Reliable document generation
• Secure handling of sensitive legal information
• Fast response and document processing

7. REQUIREMENT SUMMARY

LegalEase requires a Streamlit frontend, FastAPI backend and Gemini AI integration to generate and format customizable legal documents.
